ntent migration","routeId","routePath","kind","source",{"_640":12,"_641":47,"_642":643,"_644":645,"_646":647,"_648":649},"metadata",{"_29":30,"_31":32,"_15":16,"_600":601,"_602":-5,"_603":604,"_605":606,"_607":608},"schema",[505,506],"headings",[485,486,487,488,489,490,491,492,493,494,495,496,497,498,499,500,501,502,503,504],"sections",[116,117,118,119,120,121,122,123,124],"links",[],"assets",[],"interactions",[],"flags",{"_54":28,"_55":56,"_113":114,"_69":115},"riskNotes","5 images lack width/height; quantified or absolute proof claims require substantiation",[],{"_125":453,"_127":454,"_129":-5,"_130":455,"_132":456,"_134":457},{"_125":417,"_127":189,"_129":-5,"_130":418,"_132":419,"_134":420},{"_125":182,"_127":320,"_129":-5,"_130":378,"_132":379,"_134":380},{"_125":357,"_127":189,"_129":-5,"_130":367,"_132":368,"_134":369},{"_125":249,"_127":320,"_129":-5,"_130":321,"_132":322,"_134":323},{"_125":276,"_127":189,"_129":-5,"_130":277,"_132":278,"_134":279},{"_125":230,"_127":189,"_129":-5,"_130":231,"_132":232,"_134":233},{"_125":188,"_127":189,"_129":-5,"_130":190,"_132":191,"_134":192},{"_125":126,"_127":128,"_129":-5,"_130":131,"_132":133,"_134":135},"order",9,"sourceSelector","section.section.brand-gradient.animate","sourceId","sourceClasses",[185,186,187],"heading",{"_181":182,"_147":183},"blocks",[136,137,138,139,140,141,142,143],{"_144":132,"_125":180,"_181":182,"_147":183,"_127":184},{"_144":145,"_125":175,"_147":176,"_149":177,"_127":178},{"_144":145,"_125":171,"_147":172,"_149":173,"_127":157},{"_144":145,"_125":167,"_147":168,"_149":169,"_127":157},{"_144":145,"_125":163,"_147":164,"_149":165,"_127":157},{"_144":145,"_125":159,"_147":160,"_149":161,"_127":157},{"_144":145,"_125":154,"_147":155,"_149":156,"_127":157},{"_144":145,"_125":146,"_147":148,"_149":150,"_127":151},"type","paragraph",57,"text","Book my free trades automation audit","segments",[152],"a.btn.btn-primary",{"_144":147,"_153":148},"value",56,"Read the quote follow-up guide",[158],"a",{"_144":147,"_153":155},55,"Read the lead capture guide",[162],{"_144":147,"_153":160},54,"Read the call answering guide",[166],{"_144":147,"_153":164},53,"See trades pricing",[170],{"_144":147,"_153":168},52,"Browse all Silverstone AI services",[174],{"_144":147,"_153":172},51,"Missed calls and slow quote follow-up send good jobs elsewhere. The trades setup shows how to plug that leak without changing how you already work.",[179],"p.section-subtitle",{"_144":147,"_153":176},50,"level",2,"Ready to stop losing good jobs to missed calls?","h2.section-title","section","brand-gradient","animate",8,"section.section.bg-lines.animate",[185,227,187,228,229],{"_181":182,"_147":226},[193,194,195,196,197,198,199],{"_144":132,"_125":225,"_181":182,"_147":226,"_127":184},{"_144":145,"_125":221,"_147":222,"_149":223,"_127":203},{"_144":145,"_125":217,"_147":218,"_149":219,"_127":203},{"_144":145,"_125":213,"_147":214,"_149":215,"_127":203},{"_144":145,"_125":209,"_147":210,"_149":211,"_127":203},{"_144":145,"_125":205,"_147":206,"_149":207,"_127":203},{"_144":145,"_125":200,"_147":201,"_149":202,"_127":203},49,"Yes. We can route jobs to different people based on location, skill set or availability, using simple rules that you help define.",[204],"p",{"_144":147,"_153":201},48,"You receive simple reports showing how many calls and enquiries were captured, how many quotes were followed up and how many jobs were booked. We can review these together and adjust the system to improve results.",[208],{"_144":147,"_153":206},47,"No. You can send us updates in plain language and we handle the changes. We also review key messages periodically to ensure they still match how you operate.",[212],{"_144":147,"_153":210},46,"We can create separate flows for emergencies, including clear warnings about response times and pricing. These can be routed to a specific on-call number if you choose to offer true 24/7 coverage.",[216],{"_144":147,"_153":214},45,"Yes. We can start with simple, structured logs of calls and jobs that you can access on your phone or computer. If you later adopt a dedicated job-management tool, the automation can adapt.",[220],{"_144":147,"_153":218},44,"The experience is designed to feel like talking to a helpful office assistant. For many enquiries, callers simply leave key details and receive a clear confirmation and next steps. You can still choose to have certain calls put straight through when you are available.",[224],{"_144":147,"_153":222},43,"Trades Automation FAQs","bg-lines","parallax-section","compact-section",6,[185,227,187,228,229],{"_181":182,"_147":275},[234,235,236,237,238,239,240,241,242,243],{"_144":132,"_125":274,"_181":182,"_147":275,"_127":184},{"_144":145,"_125":270,"_147":271,"_149":272,"_127":178},{"_144":132,"_125":268,"_181":249,"_147":269,"_127":251},{"_144":145,"_125":264,"_147":265,"_149":266,"_127":203},{"_144":132,"_125":262,"_181":249,"_147":263,"_127":251},{"_144":145,"_125":258,"_147":259,"_149":260,"_127":203},{"_144":132,"_125":256,"_181":249,"_147":257,"_127":251},{"_144":145,"_125":252,"_147":253,"_149":254,"_127":203},{"_144":132,"_125":248,"_181":249,"_147":250,"_127":251},{"_144":145,"_125":244,"_147":245,"_149":246,"_127":203},42,"Clear, simple pricing with no long contracts.",[247],{"_144":147,"_153":245},41,4,"Simple, transparent pricing","h4",40,"If you prefer, emergency calls can always be routed directly to you or a trusted colleague.",[255],{"_144":147,"_153":253},39,"Emergency routing options",38,"You decide what the system can say and when calls should be passed through.",[261],{"_144":147,"_153":259},37,"Clear rules and handoff",36,"You do not need to be technical – we set it up and keep it running.",[267],{"_144":147,"_153":265},35,"No need to be technical",34,"No tech headaches, clear rules, and emergency routing when it matters.",[273],{"_144":147,"_153":271},33,"You stay in control — we do the heavy lifting",5,[185,227,187,228,229],{"_181":182,"_147":319},[280,281,282,283,284,285,286,287,288,289],{"_144":132,"_125":318,"_181":182,"_147":319,"_127":184},{"_144":145,"_125":314,"_147":315,"_149":316,"_127":178},{"_144":132,"_125":312,"_181":249,"_147":313,"_127":251},{"_144":145,"_125":308,"_147":309,"_149":310,"_127":203},{"_144":132,"_125":306,"_181":249,"_147":307,"_127":251},{"_144":145,"_125":302,"_147":303,"_149":304,"_127":203},{"_144":132,"_125":300,"_181":249,"_147":301,"_127":251},{"_144":145,"_125":296,"_147":297,"_149":298,"_127":203},{"_144":132,"_125":294,"_181":249,"_147":295,"_127":251},{"_144":145,"_125":290,"_147":291,"_149":292,"_127":203},32,"Adjust questions, messages and scheduling as patterns emerge.",[293],{"_144":147,"_153":291},31,"Refine over time",30,"Link the virtual office to your phone lines and job tools, then go live in a controlled way.",[299],{"_144":147,"_153":297},29,"Connect and launch",28,"Agree what should happen for emergencies, standard jobs and quotes.",[305],{"_144":147,"_153":303},27,"Design triage rules",26,"Understand how calls and jobs are currently handled and where work is being lost.",[311],{"_144":147,"_153":309},25,"Quick automation audit",24,"Start capturing calls fast, then refine triage and follow-up as patterns emerge.",[317],{"_144":147,"_153":315},23,"Practical setup, built for busy days","section.section.bg-circuit.animate",[185,366,187,228,229],{"_181":182,"_147":365},[324,325,326,327,328],{"_144":132,"_125":364,"_181":182,"_147":365,"_127":184},{"_144":145,"_125":360,"_147":361,"_149":362,"_127":178},{"_144":132,"_125":356,"_181":357,"_147":358,"_127":359},{"_144":145,"_125":352,"_147":353,"_149":354,"_127":203},{"_144":329,"_125":330,"_331":332,"_333":334,"_127":335},"list",22,"ordered",false,"items",[336,337,338,339],"ul",{"_147":349,"_149":350},{"_147":346,"_149":347},{"_147":343,"_149":344},{"_147":340,"_149":341},"Evenings stay freer from paperwork and catch-up admin.",[342],{"_144":147,"_153":340},"A clearer view of upcoming work and availability.",[345],{"_144":147,"_153":343},"Less time spent writing and chasing quotes manually.",[348],{"_144":147,"_153":346},"More of the right jobs get booked because fewer good calls are missed.",[351],{"_144":147,"_153":349},21,"Automation captures better calls and keeps quotes moving without burying you in admin.",[355],{"_144":147,"_153":353},20,3,"Book more jobs. Fewer late nights.","h3",19,"Capture work, qualify urgency, and keep the pipeline moving without living on your phone.",[363],{"_144":147,"_153":361},18,"More jobs booked. Fewer late nights.","bg-circuit",[185,227,187,228,229],{"_181":182,"_147":377},[370,371],{"_144":132,"_125":376,"_181":182,"_147":377,"_127":184},{"_144":145,"_125":372,"_147":373,"_149":374,"_127":178},17,"A missed call is not just an admin problem; it is revenue that may never come back.",[375],{"_144":147,"_153":373},16,"Busy periods send jobs to competitors",[185,366,187,228,229],{"_181":182,"_147":415},[381,382,383,384,385],{"_144":132,"_125":414,"_181":182,"_147":415,"_127":416},{"_144":145,"_125":410,"_147":411,"_149":412,"_127":178},{"_144":132,"_125":408,"_181":357,"_147":409,"_127":359},{"_144":145,"_125":404,"_147":405,"_149":406,"_127":203},{"_144":329,"_125":386,"_331":332,"_333":387,"_127":335},15,[388,389,390,391],{"_147":401,"_149":402},{"_147":398,"_149":399},{"_147":395,"_149":396},{"_147":392,"_149":393},"Simple scheduling flows based on how you actually work.",[394],{"_144":147,"_153":392},"Automatic quote follow-up that keeps jobs from going cold.",[397],{"_144":147,"_153":395},"Triage that separates urgent work from routine jobs.",[400],{"_144":147,"_153":398},"Call capture that sends callers an immediate confirmation.",[403],{"_144":147,"_153":401},14,"This bundle captures calls, triages jobs, and chases quotes so the right work keeps moving even when you are busy.",[407],{"_144":147,"_153":405},13,"Your virtual office on site",12,"Capture calls, qualify jobs, and follow up quotes — even when you can’t answer the phone.",[413],{"_144":147,"_153":411},11,"The Trades Pack","h2#trades-pack",1,[185,227,187,228,229],{"_181":182,"_147":452},[421,422,423,424,425],{"_144":132,"_125":230,"_181":182,"_147":452,"_127":184},{"_144":145,"_125":448,"_147":449,"_149":450,"_127":178},{"_144":132,"_125":188,"_181":357,"_147":447,"_127":359},{"_144":145,"_125":126,"_147":444,"_149":445,"_127":203},{"_144":329,"_125":426,"_331":332,"_333":427,"_127":335},10,[428,429,430,431],{"_147":441,"_149":442},{"_147":438,"_149":439},{"_147":435,"_149":436},{"_147":432,"_149":433},"Weekends disappear into catch-up admin.",[434],{"_144":147,"_153":432},"Quotes get written late and chased inconsistently.",[437],{"_144":147,"_153":435},"Most callers do not leave voicemail. They ring the next trade.",[440],{"_144":147,"_153":438},"Calls come in on site, in the van, or mid-job and go unanswered.",[443],{"_144":147,"_153":441},"When calls arrive on site or after hours, the jobs you wanted most go to whoever answers first.",[446],{"_144":147,"_153":444},"Stop losing work on the first ring.",7,"When you’re driving or on the tools, customers ring someone else — and the quote never even gets a chance.",[451],{"_144":147,"_153":449},"Missed calls mean missed jobs.",0,"section.hero.title-band",[483,484],{"_181":417,"_147":34},[458,459,460,461,462,463],{"_144":145,"_125":453,"_147":86,"_149":481,"_127":479},{"_144":145,"_125":417,"_147":84,"_149":478,"_127":479},{"_144":145,"_125":182,"_147":475,"_149":476,"_127":203},{"_144":145,"_125":357,"_147":471,"_149":472,"_127":473},{"_144":145,"_125":249,"_147":468,"_149":469,"_127":151},{"_144":145,"_125":276,"_147":464,"_149":465,"_127":466},"See the Trades pack",[467],"a.btn.btn-secondary",{"_144":147,"_153":464},"Book a free trades automation audit",[470],{"_144":147,"_153":468},"Typical fit: owner-led trades teams juggling missed calls, quote follow-up, ETAs, and admin.",[474],"p.hero-context",{"_144":147,"_153":471},"Automation that answers calls, qualifies enquiries, and chases quotes while you are on site.",[477],{"_144":147,"_153":475},[480],"a.hero-breadcrumb__link",{"_144":147,"_153":84},[482],{"_144":147,"_153":86},"hero","title-band",{"_125":453,"_181":417,"_147":34},{"_125":417,"_181":182,"_147":452},{"_125":182,"_181":357,"_147":447},{"_125":357,"_181":182,"_147":415},{"_125":249,"_181":357,"_147":409},{"_125":276,"_181":182,"_147":377},{"_125":230,"_181":182,"_147":365},{"_125":448,"_181":357,"_147":358},{"_125":188,"_181":182,"_147":319},{"_125":126,"_181":249,"_147":313},{"_125":426,"_181":249,"_147":307},{"_125":414,"_181":249,"_147":301},{"_125":410,"_181":249,"_147":295},{"_125":408,"_181":182,"_147":275},{"_125":404,"_181":249,"_147":269},{"_125":386,"_181":249,"_147":263},{"_125":376,"_181":249,"_147":257},{"_125":372,"_181":249,"_147":250},{"_125":364,"_181":182,"_147":226},{"_125":360,"_181":182,"_147":183},{"_125":453,"_507":540,"_509":541,"_511":542},{"_125":417,"_507":508,"_509":510,"_511":512},"types",[516,525,529],"rawJson","{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n    \"mainEntity\": [\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Will callers be talking to a machine?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"The experience is designed to feel like talking to a helpful office assistant. For many enquiries, callers simply leave key details and receive a clear confirmation and next steps. You can still choose to have certain calls put straight through when you are available.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Can this work if I do not have a job-management system?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Yes. We can start with simple, structured logs of calls and jobs that you can access on your phone or computer. If you later adopt a dedicated job-management tool, the automation can adapt.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What about emergencies outside normal hours?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"We can create separate flows for emergencies, including clear warnings about response times and pricing. These can be routed to a specific on-call number if you choose to offer true 24/7 coverage.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Is it complicated to update prices or services?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"No. You can send us updates in plain language and we handle the changes. We also review key messages periodically to ensure they still match how you operate.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"How do I know it is working?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"You receive simple reports showing how many calls and enquiries were captured, how many quotes were followed up and how many jobs were booked. We can review these together and adjust the system to improve results.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Can this handle more than one engineer or team?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Yes. We can route jobs to different people based on location, skill set or availability, using simple rules that you help define.\"\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }","parsed",{"_513":514,"_515":516,"_517":518},"@context","https://schema.org","@type","FAQPage","mainEntity",[519,520,521,522,523,524],{"_515":525,"_82":538,"_527":539},{"_515":525,"_82":536,"_527":537},{"_515":525,"_82":534,"_527":535},{"_515":525,"_82":532,"_527":533},{"_515":525,"_82":530,"_527":531},{"_515":525,"_82":526,"_527":528},"Question","Can this handle more than one engineer or team?","acceptedAnswer",{"_515":529,"_147":201},